  "references": [],
  "reference_note": {
    "ja": "弱磁場ループが1周期で戻る初期場との誤差、磁気エネルギー、配置固有の磁場発散を確認します。任意強度のMHDループの厳密解を主張しません。",
    "en": "Check return error against the initial weak-field loop, magnetic energy and layout-specific divergence after one transit. No exact solution is claimed for arbitrary finite-strength MHD loops."
